<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 169 IN ONE-DAY MATCH AGAINST SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 169 IN ONE-DAY MATCH AGAINST SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were bowled out for 169 in 42 overs in their one-day match against Sri Lanka in the Kenyan Centenary four-nation cricket tournament on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 169 in 42 overs (Daryll Cullinan 51; Muttiah Muralitheran 4-35).</p>
</text>
